  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, cook the ground beef over medium-high heat until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Transfer the cooked beef to a large bowl and stir in the feta cheese, kalamata olives, green olives, oregano, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
